    description: "Concept audit 2026-10-21/22 (pinned dev e9215548f6; write-up ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/concept_audit_10212026/concept-audit-vocabulary-since-0923_10222026.md). F6, verified by reading: cli.py:1845 keeps edges whose meta['io_boundary'] == category; the scalar is first-declared-wins (io_boundary.py:1614); io-boundaries itself iterates meta['io_boundaries'] (io_boundary.py:4354). --io-boundary subprocess misses the 23 ipc_recv+subprocess rows (child_process.execSync, subprocess.check_output, go Cmd.Output) and scala Process(cmd) (scalar fs_write); --io-boundary navigation_read matches 1 of its 7 rows. Fix: read io_boundaries like the io-boundaries command; repro through the CLI first."  # 14da
